1
00:00:00,836 --> 00:00:03,706
(Penny:)He's smart, he's sweet,
and in the bedroom, whew...

2
00:00:03,873 --> 00:00:07,503
(Penny:)...let me tell you, he really tries.

3
00:00:09,011 --> 00:00:11,311
(Amy:)So it does bother you.

4
00:00:11,480 --> 00:00:13,970
(Penny:)Fine, it bothers me a little.

5
00:00:14,650 --> 00:00:17,620
(Penny:)No, you know what? This is stupid.
It doesn't bother me.

6
00:00:18,554 --> 00:00:20,184
(Penny:)Okay, it bothers me.

7
00:00:21,524 --> 00:00:25,254
(Penny:)But only because she wouldn't stop laughing.
Leonard is not that funny.

8
00:00:26,896 --> 00:00:28,056
(Amy:)And there you have it...

9
00:00:28,264 --> 00:00:31,134
...prefrontal-cortex reasoning
versus limbic lust.

10
00:00:31,834 --> 00:00:34,164
(Amy:)If this were a boxing match
they might call it...

11
00:00:34,337 --> 00:00:36,237
...the Thriller Adjacent to the Amygdala.

12
00:00:40,042 --> 00:00:44,982
(Amy:)If you were a brain scientist,
you would be busting a gut right now.

13
00:00:48,017 --> 00:00:50,887
- So how was work today?
- Oh, it was all right, I guess.

14
00:00:51,053 --> 00:00:54,283
Had to Heimlich a cherry stem
out of Sheldon.

15
00:00:55,191 --> 00:00:58,021
(Leonard:)- Caught Raj right in the eye.
- Oh.

